{
  "format": 1,
  "_comment": [
    "Keys are item IDs. Keys beginning with # are item tags; a final * matches a tag prefix.",
    "deconstruct values are the exact sequence amounts produced per item.",
    "rewrite values are the exact sequence amounts consumed per copied item.",
    "Omit deconstruct or rewrite to disable that operation. An exact empty item rule overrides tag rules.",
    "Changes are loaded when a server or single-player world starts."
  ],
  "_comment_zh": [
    "普通键为物品ID；以#开头的是物品标签，标签末尾的*表示按前缀匹配。",
    "deconstruct 是每件物品分解后实际产出的四类序列。",
    "rewrite 是每复制一件物品实际消耗的四类序列。",
    "省略 deconstruct 或 rewrite 即单独禁用该操作；精确物品空规则可以覆盖标签规则。",
    "修改后重新进入服务器或单人世界即可加载。"
  ],
